<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - King County SD 412, Wash..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - King County SD 412, Wash..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $12.725 million of King County School District 412, Wash., general obligation re funding bonds, 1996 series C, with a top yield of 5.15 percent in 2009.</p>
